        "text": "=Welcome aboard, {{ $('GET Person Details1').item.json.data.firstName }}!\n\nThis channel is for you to communicate with your DQ team (currently <@{{ $('Extract User Id').item.json.userId }}>) who will be working with you throughout the Explore Stage — the place for updates, questions, quick check-ins, and anything else needed between weekly calls.\n\nAt the top of this channel you'll find a file that links to your Founder Portal, Google Drive folder, and your personal AI assistant — those will be your go-to tools throughout the process.\n\nLooking forward to getting started working with you!\n\nLeanne & the DQ team",
